      children: ["This lens isn't random paranoia. The “ideological subversion” / destabilization framework is widely associated with Cold War-era narratives and popularized in the West through interviews and lectures by former KGB informant Yuri Bezmenov. His description-demoralization, destabilization, crisis, normalization-has been repeated for decades (often without primary-source corroboration and sometimes with exaggeration). So here's the honest constraint: you should treat the model as a ", _jsx(_components.em, {
